Comment: 9,0:23:36.06,0:23:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Nicolas Buczek
Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.69,0:00:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be possible\Nto reach heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.53,0:00:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote it all down in a notebook.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:12.37,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.41,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,before I could learn his methods...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.46,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I waited over twenty years
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.29,0:00:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to gain access\Nto Jotaro Kujo's memory.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The notebook's contents are stored in it.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:28.26,0:00:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The murderer planned to steal my father's Stand\Nby giving it form.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his power!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:33.43,0:00:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My father isn't dead.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get his Stand back,\Nhe'll come back to life.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:41.56,0:00:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.78,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me, bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.45,0:00:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with Star Platinum,\Nyour precious daddy is nothing but a mummy!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.57,0:00:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Its user has my father's\Nmemory disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.75,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To find Whitesnake's user,\Nit's now or never!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:02.79,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to put him\Nthrough something.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:07.14,0:01:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a human bone?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does it belong to?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:13.93,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say it comes from an old friend.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:18.06,0:01:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My dear friend,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dio's bone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:55.53,0:02:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Damn it, it got my leg.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:57.58,0:03:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hermes, what's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.08,TiretsDefault,,627,0,0,,{\an7}– Is it a Stand attack?\N– That's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:06.54,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! It's charging at you!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost on you!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:11.84,0:03:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's definitely a Stand ability.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:41.20,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whitesnake must have given him a disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.50,0:03:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But then...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:47.58,0:03:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:49.17,0:03:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, take F.F. and get out of here.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my problem.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of it.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:58.47,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This concerns me now, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max is looking for something.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.35,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be connected\Nto my father's stolen memories.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.48,0:04:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to find something\Ninside this prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.32,0:04:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can find out what he's plotting
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.07,0:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,by reading the disc\Ninside Sports Max's head.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:19.41,0:04:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, focus on\Ngetting out of here.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:23.62,0:04:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be drowning\Nin that pipe very soon.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.46,0:04:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can hold out until then,\Nhis ability will disappear.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.17,0:04:32.79,TiretsDefault,,711,0,0,,– No, something's off.\N– What?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:34.51,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The invisible stuffed alligator.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If it moves, my strings should vibrate
Dialogue: 9,0:04:40.14,0:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and reveal its position to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's on the wall!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:54.82,0:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it, an invisible corpse\Nhas no concept of gravity.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:58.49,0:05:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can walk on the floor\Nor on the walls!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you want, you bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't just an enemy\Nyou two share anymore.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:10.83,0:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard tore off my left leg.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.34,0:05:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my leg now?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:17.13,0:05:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In its stomach?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.05,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard is my enemy, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.35,0:05:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where it is.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.31,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll bite you!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.77,0:05:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:33.19,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:34.65,0:05:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll bite me.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.36,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all\Nthese corpses know how to do.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.45,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:41.45,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand is in its mouth.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:55.59,0:05:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I let it come to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:04.22,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that\Na piece of your shoulder?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.97,0:06:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not big enough\Nto reattach.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:11.31,0:06:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It tore your shoulder right off.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.61,TiretsDefault,,668,0,0,,– Hermes, come over here\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, am I right in thinking
Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.21,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we were attacked\Nby a ghost alligator?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.42,0:06:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max controls these ghosts.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I doubt it.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.80,0:06:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too ferocious.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:43.18,0:06:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a ghost,\Nbut an invisible corpse.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.47,0:06:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A living dead whose instinct\Ndrives it to seek blood.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:52.10,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max's ability lets him\Ncreate invisible zombies.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The pipe...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:59.11,0:07:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Hermes?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sports Max?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he drown?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dark.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's further\Ndown the pipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:11.29,0:07:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These handprints...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.09,0:07:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:26.55,0:07:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat is full of stagnant water.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to rinse my mouth out.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.10,0:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing back there?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:34.98,0:07:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was I trying to go?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.27,0:07:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I remember.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The chapel...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go to the chapel.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My mission
Dialogue: 9,0:07:47.99,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,is to find that bone.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:51.12,0:07:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail,\Nthere's no need for me to remind you
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.50,0:07:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that the power I gave you\Nwill no longer be yours.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.84,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My Stand, Limp Bizkit,\Ncan find that bone.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.13,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone Whitesnake\Nordered me to find.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:11.85,0:08:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a break\Nbefore I get started.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.35,0:08:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A good wash and something to drink.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something refreshing.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:25.11,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.07,0:08:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing is perfect.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.45,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks like a bitch...\NWhat was her name again?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.71,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch it is.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.88,0:08:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't even greet me\Nwhile I'm bribing him.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it going?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:47.68,0:08:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You on duty?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really use a drink.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go get coffee with me?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.10,0:08:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we can have some fun\Nin a quiet corner.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get ourselves\Nall cleaned up together.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.78,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, how dare you touch me?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:09.74,0:09:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You touched me.\NYou'd better pay me!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:13.33,0:09:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.12,0:09:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You little shit.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:16.58,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he touch you\Nwithout even paying?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.96,0:09:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Sports Max go?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:30.42,0:09:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must have escaped from the pipe\Nwhile we were dealing with the alligator.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:35.72,0:09:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or maybe...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:37.02,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe he's already turned\Ninto an invisible corpse.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.73,0:09:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gave you a little tap.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit playing dumb!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.49,0:09:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing dumb?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:47.28,0:09:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let someone look down on you,\Nyou're done for, bitch.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If he touched you, he has to pay you.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me find his money.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening? Come on, help me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got something up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll really pay me?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:06.59,0:10:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have told me from the start.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.84,0:10:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I just told you.\NPay attention, you idiot.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:13.72,0:10:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he hiding something else?\NIn his mouth, maybe?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.23,0:10:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you want to do this here?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.99,0:10:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, quit playing dumb.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.53,0:10:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't do that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:40.45,0:10:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking this.\NGood thing I searched you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not drugs.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dripping off my skin.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This smell...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.23,0:11:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The sewers!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It reeks of sewage!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.61,0:11:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The stagnant water dripping\Nfrom my body stinks...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! No, it can't be...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.74,0:11:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:16.91,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pouring out of nowhere.\NWhat the hell is this?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.26,0:11:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A drink wasn't what I wanted\Nin the end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to devour something!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.14,0:11:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to satisfy this urge\Nand devour something!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:43.60,0:11:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, the brain!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:45.73,0:11:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now I remember.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.69,0:11:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I drowned in that pipe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:51.61,0:11:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it! She's the one who did this to me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gloria Costello's little sister!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That bitch,\Nhow dare she do this to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How dare she?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, look!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.39,0:12:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.64,0:12:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.\NHe's definitely out of the pipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:22.56,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do that to her?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he bite her to death?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.73,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Could a human do this\Nwith their teeth?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.40,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they mutilate a body\Nlike that?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:31.69,0:12:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no longer human,\Nmorally or mentally.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:36.03,0:12:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But he still has\NWhitesnake's disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes\Nto get that disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:42.66,0:12:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, wait outside.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:50.46,0:12:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he got away.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:53.92,0:12:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:55.88,0:12:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.01,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He can think like a human!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the wall!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.85,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We already know\Nhe's not on the floor!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.35,0:13:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll locate him in this room!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:13.65,0:13:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose to hang from the ceiling.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I broke a few of your bones.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.66,0:13:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He grabbed me with his broken wrist?\NHe really is a corpse.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.91,0:13:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got him!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.76,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Sports Max!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.60,0:13:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using the dead woman's body\Nas a decoy!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.49,0:14:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:07.66,0:14:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:13.84,0:14:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:16.30,0:14:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not your enemy.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:18.88,0:14:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who'll take him down.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.55,0:14:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.43,0:14:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This goes beyond
Dialogue: 9,0:14:24.93,0:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,your desire for revenge.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.81,0:14:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not even "beyond".
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.52,0:14:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're short on time and energy\Nto plan our attack.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:37.61,0:14:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.45,TiretsDefault,,700,0,0,,– It can't be...\N– He's cornered us...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.91,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a trap from the start.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.74,0:14:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already awakened them.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:52.96,0:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The invisible living dead.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.87,0:14:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how many there are.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to turn back.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:03.05,0:15:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying alive is our priority.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.93,0:15:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to escape,\Nwe have to open that door.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.35,0:15:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stretch my string as far as it goes\Nand bring F.F. here.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.73,0:15:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's retreat.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting that disc
Dialogue: 9,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and your revenge can wait.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.86,0:15:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:22.53,0:15:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My revenge...
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.15,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.45,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge matters more than anything,\Neven to Sports Max,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.79,0:15:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,who's hiding somewhere\Nin this room.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:34.41,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants revenge for being drowned.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.13,0:15:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be consumed by revenge.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:41.71,0:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to mutilate me to death\Nand fill his mouth with my blood.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.26,0:15:51.14,TiretsDefault,,665,0,0,,– What are you...\N– Sports Max won't let
Dialogue: 9,0:15:51.35,0:15:53.97,TiretsDefault,,613,0,0,,– anyone else kill me.\N– Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:54.56,0:15:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.02,0:15:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Some will say that getting revenge\Nwon't bring my sister back.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But they have no idea\Nwhat I've been through.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:03.03,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Others tell me\Nthat forgiveness matters.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I should force myself to forget\Nwhat it feels like
Dialogue: 9,0:16:13.33,0:16:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to have your sister thrown in a gutter\Nand just keep on living?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to live like that.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.79,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've prepared for this moment\Nfor a long time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.50,0:16:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge is the only way\Nto settle things with my fate.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.93,0:16:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight to the death?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.35,0:16:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. Step back, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I just reached F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Five, no, seven of the living dead
Dialogue: 9,0:16:40.03,0:16:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,are cutting through my strings\Nand will be on us soon!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:43.61,0:16:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which side will he strike from?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.79,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My conscience...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:13.43,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She copied his head with her sticker!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:16.31,0:17:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This kiss sticker{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is the mark of my revenge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.52,0:17:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you, Sports Max!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:25.86,0:17:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd try it.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.28,0:17:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like when you trapped me in that pipe,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:32.49,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd use\Nthat sticker to copy an object.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.71,0:17:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ability won't work on me anymore.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:42.80,0:17:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,already dead.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it didn't work.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:48.30,0:17:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.72,0:17:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hear me, can you?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:52.97,0:17:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I'll tell you anyway.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.93,0:18:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your sister's fault\Nfor seeing what she shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Missed again!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of your sister,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:14.54,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I ended up in your hands,\Nand look at me now.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:18.33,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never recover from this feeling.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.71,0:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not him!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or him!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.38,0:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I eat your brain
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.30,0:18:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and stuff my shit\Ninto your empty skull,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:35.64,0:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget what you did to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:43.73,0:18:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish you off!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:50.53,0:18:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes was waiting for this moment!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.03,0:18:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment he'd remove the sticker\Nand shred his head apart!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:58.54,0:18:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When the sticker comes off,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:00.08,0:19:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the copy fuses with the original.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.21,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Sports Max\Nswallowed the copy earlier!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:06.21,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where you are!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:09.63,0:19:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim a little higher!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:11.55,0:19:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The median sagittal plane of your face!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She got him!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This blow is for Gloria.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.57,0:19:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the bones in your face\Njust shattered.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:32.74,0:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine Gloria\Nbeating your face in.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.62,0:19:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,is for Gloria, too!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Chow down on this bitch\Nand turn her into mincemeat!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking of hiding again.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:49.09,0:19:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.92,0:19:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A sticker split your head in two.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.63,0:19:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When I remove this sticker,\Nit returns to the original.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:59.51,0:20:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The next blow is for Gloria, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.10,0:20:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And the one after that.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And the one after that!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:11.32,0:20:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all for Gloria!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.24,0:20:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This one,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and that one, too!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:19.45,0:20:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.45,0:20:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And this!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:23.24,0:20:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This, this and this!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This, this, this and this!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.59,0:20:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all for Gloria!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:59.11,0:21:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why,\Nbut I've started crying.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.99,0:21:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to cry by your side.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:11.67,0:21:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,\NI think I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Come heal her!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.69,0:21:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.31,0:21:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alert,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:23:04.16,0:23:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sector 1A, mausoleum.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:23:06.66,0:23:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:08.12,0:23:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:23:09.21,0:23:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody move!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:15.83,0:23:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate FE40536.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:18.88,0:23:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Name: Jolyne Kujo!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:27.14,0:23:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that I've read this disc,\NI understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:23:29.80,0:23:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know what I have left to do here.{\i0}
